  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Bangladesh Purchasing Managers&#x2019; Index (PMI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMI data is published for sale by companies such as Standard and Poor&#x2019;s. Singapore Institute of Purchasing and Materials Management (SIPMM) provides training and has experience of setting up the Chinese PMI. Under TEPP programme, SIPMM will work towards developing Bangladesh Purchasing Managers&#x2019; Index (PMI).</narrative>
  </description>
